  <p id="c-nanshi-024-wangdeyuan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangdeyuan:p001:m0000" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">晏</persName>子<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangdeyuan:p001:m0002" ref="i08_s4b_5bb_A">德元</persName>，有意尚，位車騎長史。<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangdeyuan:p001:m0015" ref="i08_s4b_5bb_A">德元</persName>初名<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangdeyuan:p001:m0019" ref="i08_s4b_5bb_A">湛</persName>，武帝曰：「<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangdeyuan:p001:m0026" ref="h3c_ulm_pto">劉湛</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangdeyuan:p001:m0029" ref="o1i_tao_gu1">江湛</persName>，並不善終，此非佳名也。」<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangdeyuan:p001:m0044" ref="i08_s4b_5bb">晏</persName>乃改之，至是及誅。</p>
</text>
